flowchart LR
    detector[检测器与车辆事件]
    network[路网与路口模型]
    data[实时数据链路]
    algorithm[配时与协调算法]
    recommendation[候选控制方案]
    review[校验与人工审核]
    dispatcher[方案下发服务]
    controller[信号机]
    observer[实时状态与效果评价]

    detector --> data
    network --> data
    data --> algorithm
    network --> algorithm
    algorithm --> recommendation
    recommendation --> review
    review --> dispatcher
    dispatcher --> controller
    controller --> observer
    observer --> data
    network --> review

